{{!
    @template mod_qrvote/station

    Heading of the vote page: activity name and, for a station, its title, location and voting window.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name - Activity name, formatted with format_string().
    * isstation - Whether the round is a station.
    * title - Station title.
    * location - Station location.
    * window - Formatted voting window.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Conference feedback",
        "isstation": true,
        "title": "Moodle and AI",
        "location": "Room 104",
        "window": "Saturday, 24 October, 10:00 AM to 11:30 AM"
    }
}}
<div class="mod_qrvote-station mb-3">
    <h2 class="h4 mb-1">{{name}}</h2>
    {{#isstation}}
    <p class="h5 mb-1">{{title}}</p>
    <p class="text-muted mb-0">{{#location}}{{location}} · {{/location}}{{window}}</p>
    {{/isstation}}
</div>
